- desired agent filter;
- accepted agent filter;
- desired selected run;
- accepted selected run detail;
- manual-selection revision/intent identity;
- independent generations;
- owned cancellation sources;
- loading, refreshing, stale, failed and unavailable phases;
- immutable accepted collections;
- bounded safe errors;
- retry identities;
- disposal.

