- null agent filter means All;
- Guid.Empty is invalid;
- a missing explicit agent never silently falls back to All;
- an A completion cannot publish after B is desired;
- run list data is accepted before detail loading completes;
- detail failure preserves the accepted list;
- a manual R2 selection cannot be overwritten by an older R1 detail;
