- loading unresolved requested agent -> Loading;
- missing explicit requested agent -> Failed;
- accepted list with no runs -> Ready;
- accepted list with detail loading -> Ready unless product context requires
  the detail;
- accepted list with detail failure -> Ready with detail warning;
- stale previous target data is never published as the new target context.

Log safe identities and exception types. Do not render raw exception text.

